## Conclusion

Renting wedding AV from MEG comes with real, specific advantages: professional brand name gear, a live technician included on the Wedding Pack, transparent flat pricing, and no storage burden afterward. It also comes with real limits: fixed guest count tiers, delivery only with no self pickup, no showroom, and no negotiation on price. Weigh both sides against your own wedding rather than a generic list, and [contact us](/contact/) to check availability and get an honest quote for your date.

## FAQs

### What are the real advantages of renting wedding AV instead of buying it?

Professional brand name gear (Audix, QSC and Martin), a live technician included on the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/), flat transparent pricing with delivery and teardown built in, and no equipment to store or maintain after the wedding.

### What are the real downsides of Malaga Event Gear's wedding packages?

Only two fixed guest count tiers (50 or 80, no in between sizing), delivery only with no self pickup option, no walk in showroom to test gear beforehand, and fixed prices with no negotiation or off season discount.

### Is it worth buying my own PA system and lighting for a single wedding?

For most couples, no. The upfront cost of professional grade gear rarely pays off for a single event, and there is usually no realistic plan for storing or maintaining it afterward. Renting trades that cost and burden for one flat fee.

### Should I rent an AV package or hire a full production company?

A full production company offers a larger team and fully custom staging, at a higher price than a package like the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/). For most weddings under 80 guests, that level of customization is more than the day needs, and the Wedding Pack's fixed price and included technician cover the same core job for less.

### Does the Wedding Pack include a technician, or do I run the sound myself?

The Wedding Pack includes a live technician on site throughout the event. The [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/), for up to 50 guests, is self run after our crew delivers, installs and tests it, a real difference worth weighing alongside the 360 euro price gap.

### Can I negotiate the price or get a self pickup option to save money?

No to both. MEG's package prices are fixed with no negotiation, price matching or off season discount, and we operate delivery only with no self pickup option under any circumstances.
